{"articleNo":"2099","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2099&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"핀란드 정부초청 장학생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.11.02","hit":"7915","attachments":[{"name":"붙임4-2012핀란드 DB양식.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2099&attachNo=70951"},{"name":"붙임1-2012핀란드정부초청장학생선발요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2099&attachNo=71024"},{"name":"붙임3-Finnish Government Scholarship Pool.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2099&attachNo=71118"},{"name":"붙임2-핀란드지원서A.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2099&attachNo=71120"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t핀란드 정부에서는 아래와 같이 장학생을 모집하고 있습니다. &nbsp;관심 있는 우리 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.&nbsp;<br><br><!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;\">- Finnish Government Scholarship Pool -</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;1. 선발 인원 및 장학금 지급기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(1) 주관: 핀란드 국제교류센터(Center for International Mobility, CIMO) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) 인원; ○명 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) 장학금 지급 기간 : 3개월-9개월 (2012.9.-)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 우리 정부(국립국제교육원)는 총 10명 이내로 선발, 핀란드정부에 추천할 예정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 핀란드정부는 전 세계에서 추천된 지원자를 대상으로 최종 선발.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;2. 장학금 지급내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(1) 생활비 : 매월 1,200유로 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) 숙소(기숙사)는 지급되는 장학금으로 본인이 해결해야 함. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) 항공료·의료보험료 본인 부담(출국전 보험 가입 필수) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;3. 지원 자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (1) 대한민국 국적을 소지한 자로서, 건강·병역 등 해외유학에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) 석사학위 이상 소지자 - 2012. 2월 취득예정자 포함 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) 핀란드 소재 대학원 또는 고등교육/연구기관으로부터 다음 자격으로 초청장을 받은 자 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대학원과정 방문학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 연구프로젝트 과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대학/기관에서 강의를 하게 된 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※박사과정 방문학생을 우대하여 선발함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(4) 대학원 수학/연구 수행에 필요한 충분한 언어능력을 입증할 수 있는 자 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(5) 수학·연구 종료 후 귀국하여 국내에서 활동할 수 있는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※장학금기간이 시작되는 시점을 기준으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">핀란드 대학원/연구기관에 1년 이상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">체류한 경력이 있으면 지원할 수 없음</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;4. 선발 절차:</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">첨부 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;5. 제출 서류: 첨부 참조</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">붙임1. 2012핀란드정부초청장학생선발요강 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 핀란드지원서A &nbsp;1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. Finnish Government Scholarship Pool 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 2012핀란드 DB양식 1부. 끝.&nbsp; </span></p>\n<br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
